OL,3,APlans unveiled for one of UK's biggest
OL,4,Asolar farms
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been unveiled to build one
OL,7,Fof the biggest solar farms in the UK
OL,8,Facross a huge slice of Essex's Dengie
OL,9,FPeninsula.
OL,11,FLow Carbon wants to install panels
OL,12,Facross 4,200 acres (1,700 hectares) of
OL,13,Fsprawling countryside between
OL,14,FBurnham-on-Crouch and Bradwell-on-Sea.
OL,16,FThe developer said the site could
OL,17,Fgenerate 1GW of power - enough to
OL,18,Fsupply 250,000 homes, or every house
OL,19,Fbetween Basildon and Shoeburyness.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
